## Original Content
Les Forces démocratiques syriennes, dont le chef Mazloum Abdi a annoncé, mardi, la dissolution en vertu d'un accord avec le président Ahmed al-Charaa, constituaient l'armée des Kurdes de Syrie et avaient vaincu avec le soutien de l'Occident les jihadistes du groupe État islamique.

## Summary
The Syrian Democratic Forces (SDF), led by Mazloum Abdi, have announced their dissolution as part of an agreement with the Syrian government under President Ahmed al-Charaa. The SDF was the Kurdish military force in Syria and played a crucial role in defeating ISIS with Western support.

## Key Points
- The SDF is dissolving following an agreement with the Damascus government.
- Mazloum Abdi is the leader who announced the dissolution.
- The SDF was instrumental in defeating ISIS in Syria.
- Western support was vital for the SDF's success against ISIS.
- This dissolution represents a significant political and military shift in the region.


